  "body": "Hi! This is my first issue in this repository, I'm sorry if I'm opening this discussion in the wrong place. I searched the mailing list archives and issues for this topic but couldn't find a relevant discussion.\r\n\r\nThe spec says that the `<form>` `method` attribute assumes [one of three values](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#form-submission): `get`, `post`, and `dialog`. \r\n\r\nCan we add support for the `put`, `patch`, and `delete` methods for this attribute?",
